{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-02-24 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT INTRODUCES ENHANCED 5G VISIBILITY SOLUTIONS FOR MOBILE SERVICE PROVIDERS', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, ANNOUNCES ENHANCED 5G NETWORK VISIBILITY SOLUTIONS WITH INDUSTRY-LEADING PERFORMANCE THROUGH THE KEYSIGHT VISION X NETWORK PACKET BROKER (NPB), ENABLING MOBILE SERVICE PROVIDERS TO IMPROVE SERVICE QUALITY MONITORING WHILE REDUCING THEIR SERVICE ASSURANCE COSTS.'}